{"screen_name": "picture88make41", "file": "picture88make41", "name": "まこ()skeb募集中！", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1272400520049618945/mlatP5au.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/2912974796/1625655028/1500x500", "description": "イラストを描いてる人です。ai学習、無断転載🚫【skeb】http://skeb.jp/@picture88make41 【fanbox】https://zph2qbrl.fanbox.cc 【🔞】@mako18_mako81", "total_works": 10, "scraped_works": 10, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 5000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T13:59:00.671621+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 5000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 5000, "max": 5000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/picture88make41", "name": "picture88make41"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://zph2qbrl.fanbox.cc", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/24827938", "name": "24827938"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": true, "works": [{"path": "/@picture88make41/works/10", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/4f9612ce/uploads/origins/a52326a1-842a-48e4-8c27-440a2f7da958?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7826429bd5934ffb0014ededc2f19900", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/4f9612ce/uploads/origins/a52326a1-842a-48e4-8c27-440a2f7da958?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7826429bd5934ffb0014ededc2f19900, https://si.imgix.net/4f9612ce/uploads/origins/a52326a1-842a-48e4-8c27-440a2f7da958?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=3bfdf4a6de74e9f0f40c8786799c0ac4 2x, https://si.imgix.net/4f9612ce/uploads/origins/a52326a1-842a-48e4-8c27-440a2f7da958?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=663dbf2aef453efb389c58eb0a95dc15 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、まこさん.\n以前は素敵なイラストを描いていただき、ありがとうございました.\n今回、同じキャラクターを「剣を突き刺して立つ」ポーズで、新しい見た目（衣装・身長・髪型など）に変更したイラストをお願いしたいと考えています.\n\n参考資料\n\nポーズ:\nhttps://www.kamitokatachi.com/entry/2016/09/25/195835\nhttps://hololive.hololivepro.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Elizabeth-Rose-Bloodflame_pr-img_01.png\n\n剣: https://i.imgur.com/jPvGDIK.png\n\n新しい見た目: https://imgur.com/a/XLYyCqV\n\nこれらの参考画像はあくまでイメージの一例ですので、アレンジやご自身の表現を加えていただいて問題ありません.\n\nなお、もし可能であれば、「翼なし」の差分も拝見できると嬉しいです。（任意です）\n\nお忙しいところ恐縮ですが、ご検討のほどよろしくお願いいたします.\n\n\n英語:\nHi まこさま!\nthank you for your work on the last artwork!\ni would like to request the character from the last request with a different look and in a pose with a sword on ground while resting the hands on the hilt\n\nReferences:\n\nPose: https://www.kamitokatachi.com/entry/2016/09/25/195835\nhttps://hololive.hololivepro.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/06/Elizabeth-Rose-Bloodflame_pr-img_01.png\n\nSword: https://i.imgur.com/jPvGDIK.png\n\nAltered Look: https://imgur.com/a/XLYyCqV\n\nAny variation is okay and welcome\n\nThanks!\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/XLYyCqV", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@picture88make41/works/9", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ccb42932/uploads/origins/c04149b2-e937-4a6e-bd7f-ed32fe16f3a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55a906b98d7c93be47cd0304deafe9c0", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ccb42932/uploads/origins/c04149b2-e937-4a6e-bd7f-ed32fe16f3a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=55a906b98d7c93be47cd0304deafe9c0, https://si.imgix.net/ccb42932/uploads/origins/c04149b2-e937-4a6e-bd7f-ed32fe16f3a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04ac852aa53eee1c69ba1e42d56c4a53 2x, https://si.imgix.net/ccb42932/uploads/origins/c04149b2-e937-4a6e-bd7f-ed32fe16f3a6?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=04faebd27f23d080a8c99c103072b033 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、元気っ娘のテイストで私のOCを描いていただけませんか？\n全体の雰囲気はこの画像（ https://imgur.com/a/aI3yT1I ）を、\n衣装はこの画像（ https://imgur.com/a/af44eat ）を参考にしていただければと思います。\n\nなお、これらの参考画像はあくまで一例ですので、自由にご自身のアイデアを取り入れていただいて構いません。\n\n元気っ娘 https://the-dere-types.fandom.com/wiki/Other:Genkikko/Gallery#Characters_from_Anime.2C_Manga_.26_Light_Novels \nhttps://skeb.jp/@mado_od/works/13\n\n\n英語:\nHi, can you draw me my character in a genkikko personality\nstyle: https://imgur.com/a/aI3yT1I\noutfit: https://imgur.com/a/af44eat\nany variation is welcome\n\nexample for genkikko characters: https://the-dere-types.fandom.com/wiki/Other:Genkikko/Gallery#Characters_from_Anime.2C_Manga_.26_Light_Novels \nthis one is exceptional: https://skeb.jp/@mado_od/works/13\n\nThank you for your time\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/af44eat", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@picture88make41/works/8", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/efffa535/uploads/origins/75ac36ba-592a-4f25-8709-6529ec1ce2cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a9c2bc84bba730de4ffb6213397fbe3", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/efffa535/uploads/origins/75ac36ba-592a-4f25-8709-6529ec1ce2cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=0a9c2bc84bba730de4ffb6213397fbe3, https://si.imgix.net/efffa535/uploads/origins/75ac36ba-592a-4f25-8709-6529ec1ce2cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2564693907a9c0f187b60db3844f025a 2x, https://si.imgix.net/efffa535/uploads/origins/75ac36ba-592a-4f25-8709-6529ec1ce2cd?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=c9fcc7c805421f53d9b944636fa2805b 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "こんにちは、\n\nドールズフロントラインのSTG44（通常衣装）とFate:Grand Orderの織田信長を一緒に描いていただけませんか？あなたの作品がとても好きなので、詳細はあなた次第です！\n\nありがとうございます！\n\nhttps://wikiwiki.jp/dolls-fl/StG44\nhttps://w.atwiki.jp/f_go/pages/477.html", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@picture88make41/works/7", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/3140bb17/uploads/origins/be11d44b-c872-4bb4-bc21-c1